{"id":40434,"mal_id":40434,"title":"Mo Dao Zu Shi: Wanjie Pian","englishTitle":"The Master of Diabolism 3","title_english":"The Master of Diabolism 3","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["The Master of Diabolism 3rd Season","Grandmaster of Demonic Cultivation 3","The Founder of Diabolism 3","Mo Dao Zu Shi 3rd Season","Mo Dao Zu Shi Final Arc","MDZS"],"en":"The Master of Diabolism 3","ja":"魔道祖师 完结篇"},"synopsis":"Along an empty road in the rural countryside, Wei Wuxian and Lan Wangji stumble across a stone plaque that reads \"Yi City.\" Still on their quest to unravel the mystery behind the cursed severed arm, they venture into the deserted city to obtain further leads.\n\nHowever, with the appearance of a mysterious new cultivator, the demonic arm investigation leads Wei Wuxian and Lan Wangji to a plot that threatens the cultivation world as they know it. The gravity of the new situation escalates when the two find it involves the chief cultivator of the renowned Lanling Jin Sect—Jin Guangyao.\n\nAs the pair continue to piece together the crucial conspiracies of the cultivation history, their friends and colleagues grow suspicious of their motives. With the world against him, Wei Wuxian must prove he is not the demonic sorcerer people believe him to be to regain their trust and save the cultivation world from the sinister evil lurking within it.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]\n","synopsis_es":"A lo largo de un camino vacío en el campo, Wei Wuxian y Lan Wangji se topan con una placa de piedra que dice \"Ciudad Yi\". Aún en su búsqueda para desentrañar el misterio detrás del brazo amputado maldito, se aventuran en la ciudad desierta para obtener más pistas.\n\nSin embargo, con la aparición de un nuevo y misterioso cultivador, la investigación del brazo demoníaco lleva a Wei Wuxian y Lan Wangji a un complot que amenaza el mundo del cultivo tal como lo conocen. La gravedad de la nueva situación aumenta cuando los dos descubren que se trata del principal cultivador de la renombrada Secta Lanling Jin: Jin Guangyao.\n\nMientras la pareja continúa reconstruyendo las conspiraciones cruciales de la historia del cultivo, sus amigos y colegas sospechan de sus motivos. Con el mundo en su contra, Wei Wuxian debe demostrar que no es el hechicero demoníaco que la gente cree que es para recuperar su confianza y salvar al mundo de cultivo del siniestro mal que acecha en su interior.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"ONA","media_type":"ona","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1492,"average_episode_duration":1492,"startDate":"2021-08-07","start_date":"2021-08-07","endDate":"2021-10-16","end_date":"2021-10-16","season":"summer","year":2021,"start_season":{"year":2021,"season":"summer"},"episodes":12,"num_episodes":12,"score":8.63,"mean":8.63,"numListUsers":99177,"num_list_users":99177,"genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action"},{"id":2,"name":"Adventure"},{"id":8,"name":"Drama"},{"id":10,"name":"Fantasy"},{"id":13,"name":"Historical"},{"id":7,"name":"Mystery"},{"id":6,"name":"Mythology"},{"id":72,"name":"Reincarnation"}],"studios":[{"id":1350,"name":"B.CMAY PICTURES"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/mDIMt1vr7hcZRlcUz5hHY2q2M6r.jpg","logo_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mrvndOpCCoyAQ0BXTdQsii7AwG6.png","tmdb_id":"80732","tmdb_updated_at":"2026-11-21T22:34:38.842Z","images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1634/116782.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1634/116782l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1634/116782.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1634/116782l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1634/116782l.webp"}},"broadcast":null,"rank":97,"popularity":2489,"rating":"r","num_scoring_users":35993,"nsfw":"white","source":"web_novel","related_anime":[{"node":{"id":38450,"title":"Mo Dao Zu Shi: Xian Yun Pian","main_picture":{"mediu